## Matches — Home Team

Join `matches.home_team_id` to `teams.team_id`. Home means the designated match side, not the host country. Use IDs for the join and name properties for readable results.

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| worldcup_en_matches | worldcup_en_teams | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| home_team_id | team_id |
